          "content": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "Both leaves belong to similar plants and remain in the same soil. The important difference is light: the exposed leaf receives it, while the covered leaf does not. Because only the lit leaf has the condition needed to make food, soil cannot explain the different outcomes."
            ]
